# One line per dtb of the SM8650 variants that the TB520FU bootloader can pick, in the
# order of the stock vendor_boot dtb (pineapple.dtb, entries 4-7 of 11; the cliffs and
# volcano entries belong to other SoCs and are never selected on SM8650).
# name  base dts (relative to qcom/)  component overlays in the order they are applied
